Derived work
------------

tier4/applet-mitm/source/vic40_config.hpp transcribes the VIC 4.0 register
methods and configuration-struct layout from libdrm's Tegra backend
(vic.h / vic40.h, Copyright (c) 2018 NVIDIA Corporation, MIT). Every one of the
nine config structs in it was diffed field-for-field and bit-for-bit against
those headers.
